 "notes": "Extracted from Figure 4 (upper plot) showing SQUID and paramagnets limits on spin-mass interactions mediated by ALPs. The curve represents the boundary of the excluded parameter space for monopole-dipole interactions via pseudoscalar boson mediators. The data was extracted using calibrated axis coordinates from the PDF figure. The paper reports these as limits on g_a^e g_s^e (pseudoscalar-scalar coupling product) versus ALP mediator mass. Conversion to canonical g_s g_p notation: g_a^e (pseudoscalar coupling to electron) corresponds to g_p, and g_s^e (scalar coupling to electron) corresponds to g_s. The quoted limit is g_a^e g_s^e \u2264 5.7 \u00d7 10^-32 for \u03bb > 10 cm, consistent with the extracted curve. Confidence level 95% from paper.",
